# The local verification loop and Continuous Integration only. Not shipped, not scanned by
# the platform: `requirements-dev.txt` is not a filename the analyser knows, so nothing
# here reaches the image or the platform's dependency scan.
#
# Nested on the test set, which is itself nested on the runtime set, so one install gives
# the whole loop and the subset relation cannot drift.
-r requirements.in

